# Reading on without a pause (a page every 2 s for 72 s): the position must still be saved while
# reading (SR-PL-08: at most one interval, 60 s, is lost on a power cut). The idle save (8 s after the
# last turn) never fires here: the script ends 1 s after the last turn. Audit AUD-004 (2026-11).
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # 阅读 (favourite)
+2500ms  tap   50% 57%            # 测试长书: the third shelf row (reader-one-1)
+3s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+2s      key   next
+1s      end
